": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1257169869257043", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820648_1257169872590376_3704678405841889113_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Idh0KVg5v2gQ7kNvwH40C2P&_nc_oc=Adr83zJNH2bLyOmyN-RQFVt_JBMqtuXXv5FzYQEKNok1l78EupamJ_4zjATqYDFg7O0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHS4jYayjI3Dasswtfcb21q9Vq3puqxkqOzQ5ZfBX7Tpg&oe=6A8441BC"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1593559845364804", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304305_1593559848698137_5006246285640620137_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K8uGxEy46sIQ7kNvwEqPz-D&_nc_oc=AdoYyLgYTxgPUF61XKT2UR54Ave9vLRL6R0xCnv7o1Jl3RBPaPyvDmnDnpb_yJhPhII&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFnhsKgpE6gSFLjwCO74vK2nG8MPWudvFVMB_67BR4EYA&oe=6A845AEC"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "2157379071374193", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828842_2157379074707526_1945640424716555186_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Sv0WeWn4RDwQ7kNvwEs7F-Y&_nc_oc=Adp-D19zhKU7AIj52T6TP7WJ0ab5XxMyxwWcDH0VtLWwIYAJtTw6Fn2c6LkkYmJ0C6Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQELlz8OWnRpIQxrXgf30xal9NqiGZ858HeX8xjZrkb51g&oe=6A843EB0"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1009406078036722", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819396_1009406081370055_390968474089104374_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4i7QZ8i6dSoQ7kNvwGk8J9b&_nc_oc=AdphLg4-VDtsbsM7mnZlRpq6YilTZjwamD_Ac8sOAb3rOy9VzVya6Ms9uvYQ1NHyFfQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGobTg8m79ybd4Tpwg2AKZkgNPef_EfMY_XgfwgaQYIUQ&oe=6A844F4D"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1482291982937646", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300636_1482291986270979_3477486190926684877_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EwTjBztdOs4Q7kNvwGOEBx9&_nc_oc=Adpv_bVSwgJRjlO7ozMErXZqE-5AT7MywFsGJiZmY9Qd3Bm3uW05V6ivtaVSJXTrOsQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFG-R54wUUjaKTU0qW07HKmulDZJguSC4D4zHD5lP89MQ&oe=6A845938"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "2D Calendar", "keywords": ["calendar", "daily", "date"], "long_description": "This calendar is designed to be easy to use from Meta Quest and has many features for easy use.\n\n## Main Calendar Features\n\n### 1. Calendar View\n- Tap any day to add an event\n- Long press any day to quickly add an event\n- Days with events show visual indicators\n- Monthly navigation with smooth transitions\n- \"Go to today\" quick navigation button\n- Interactive event details popup when clicking dates with events\n\n### 2. Add Events\n- Main floating action button (+) to add events\n- Comprehensive form with required field validation\n- Event title (mandatory field)\n- Auto-selected date based on calendar selection\n- Optional event description\n- Optional time picker with 12/24-hour format support\n- Automatic database saving\n\n### 3. View All Events\n- Secondary floating action button (list icon) to view all events\n- Chronologically ordered event list\n- Complete event information display with icons\n- Total events counter\n- Empty state message when no events exist\n- Rich formatting with time and date information\n\n### 4. Event Management\n- Delete events with confirmation dialog\n- Automatic view updates after changes\n- Date-specific event viewing (AlertDialog showing all events for selected date)\n- Confirmation messages for all actions\n- Real-time calendar indicator updates\n- Persistent storage across app sessions\n", "short_description": "Calendar with daily log"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ZCXNCsBn5eclu-NVLLD8u10iDNwaaBsQ7XmLx0OAy2Y/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Pop Software Developer", "support_websi